          "text": {
            "text": "Located just on the busy junction of Dalston Lane and Kingsland High Street. It has a large step-free main entrance, adjacent is another entrance from the bus station, again it is step-free.\n\nFrom the main entrance, on the left are a few ticket machines, ticket office and lift to the platforms. In the centre, leading down from the main concourse are a flight of around 20 steps to the platforms.\n\nThe trains serve the overground network and connect to various TFL services such as the London Underground and DLR. The trains run regularly which take you to Central, North and South London.\nThe platforms are wide and have ample seating available.\n\nAlways clean and bright. Staff have always been very helpful. A very pleasant station to commute to and from.",
            "languageCode": "en"
          },
